[BriefingSubmissions.SIEGE.defend_prk.attack_usa.Mission.Failed]
Enemy captured the inhabited locality.

[BriefingSubmissions.SIEGE.defend_prk.attack_usa.Mission.Description]
The inhabited locality stands on the main transport corridor that connects the eastern and western parts of the province. The enemy has gathered a major force to capture the pass. Your combat team must hold the line for the specified time.

[BriefingSubmissions.DEFEND.defend_prk.attack_usa.Mission.Description]
The inhabited locality stands on the main transport corridor that connects the eastern and western parts of the province. The enemy has gathered a major force to capture the pass. Your combat team must hold off the enemy attack at all costs. Do not allow the hostiles to capture the position.

